1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,395
Plot concentration against time and you get a curve that falls ever more slowly, and never quite reaches zero.

2
00:00:07,395 --> 00:00:13,645
But plot the log of concentration against time, and it is a straight line with slope minus k.

3
00:00:13,645 --> 00:00:16,627
That straight line is the test for first order.

4
00:00:16,627 --> 00:00:20,403
Change k, and only the steepness changes.

